{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of You is a cute, purely visual, accessible, family-friendly puzzle adventure with unique gameplay. Play and pause time in every part of the level to unveil the right path for the main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636860/extras/ecb15f0f3d4b30efb087562995aa4a97.poster.avif?t=1759317752\" width=1200 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636860/extras/ecb15f0f3d4b30efb087562995aa4a97.webm?t=1759317752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636860/extras/ecb15f0f3d4b30efb087562995aa4a97.mp4?t=1759317752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will follow the journey of a clumsy chicken traversing all kinds of places in search of her lost chicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636860/extras/11dbdc06a0cf4440a8861512961067c6.poster.avif?t=1759317752\" width=1600 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636860/extras/11dbdc06a0cf4440a8861512961067c6.webm?t=1759317752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636860/extras/11dbdc06a0cf4440a8861512961067c6.mp4?t=1759317752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange places filled with fun characters, exciting surprises, and many treacherous dangers \u2013 all to find every one of your chicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636860/extras/3d5314bf6955b89163382c4e4237059a.poster.avif?t=1759317752\" width=960 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636860/extras/3d5314bf6955b89163382c4e4237059a.webm?t=1759317752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636860/extras/3d5314bf6955b89163382c4e4237059a.mp4?t=1759317752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INNOVATIVE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a one-of-a-kind game mechanic that allows you to control the environment around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SURPRISING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through unique levels with new locations, characters, and music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CUTE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the collectibles that show nostalgic moments of the chicken and her chicks.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Eggs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636860/81f794ace9718986a976f93b12a8b55e703c6122.jpg"},{"name":"Building the Nest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636860/9cc091b71e411027484854232601d87ed78bb079.jpg"},{"name":"Holding On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636860/672a18968d1aae3b543c96a36daedeca695d3b66.jpg"},{"name":"Almost There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636860/159ee1205594241ed538fd3ee7b4a89ad62c2058.jpg"},{"name":"Finally Together!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636860/602c4f211ce933d57bc1d0aa839c8a6569034e83.jpg"},{"name":"The Nightmare is Over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636860/04fcdb11155a7f00b8ce744d05be33e43b0691fc.jpg"},{"name":"Never Forget","path":"https://cdn.akama